{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"b71853ae-b223-4533-8f4f-de766943fc56","step_index":25,"state":"DONE","step_type":"agent_response","text_delta":"{"blockers":["【输入法会话作废与迟到 input 尾随事件契约缺口】当前 blk-tech-interface 中 input 事件仅做 !isComposing \u0026\u0026 !e.isComposing 校验，未建立清空操作后的会话作废/世代隔离边界。依据 input:f1b903e2-8899-458d-a8cb-d51d9626df64 中的合成反例（compositionstart -\u003e 清空递增 activeSessionId -\u003e 旧 compositionend 被拒绝 -\u003e 迟到 noncomposing input 仍调度 300ms），会导致清空后新造空值报错或回写旧文本。受影响块 ID：blk-tech-data-model, blk-tech-interface, blk-tech-error, blk-deliv-task-input-workflow, blk-deliv-task-reset-workflow, blk-acc-input-display, blk-deliv-acc-full-e2e。依据：input:f1b903e2-8899-458d-a8cb-d51d9626df64、MDN CompositionEvent 与 beforeinput 官方规范。建议由后续整合任务设计会话世代隔离或输入状态机，隔离旧会话尾随事件并保障新用户输入正常流转。","【清空性能验收指标名称残留不一致】当前 blk-deliv-val-perf-benchmark.passCriteria 仍残留“清空重置渲染耗时”，与 steps 实测从 click 触发至 requestAnimationFrame 重绘前回调的起止端点定义冲突，后者仅为清空处理与重绘前调度延迟的代理指标，不代表物理渲染完成。受影响块 ID：blk-prod-outcomes, blk-deliv-val-perf-benchmark。依据：input:f1b903e2-8899-458d-a8cb-d51d9626df64、MDN requestAnimationFrame 官方规范（evidence-7a463cf7-74f1-4627-b9b3-24784ae3a9bc）。建议由后续整合任务统一命名为“清空重置至重绘前调度延迟”，并维持 5 轮均值 \u003c= 50ms 与未实现应用的待验证（unexecuted）状态。"],"clarification":null,"evidence":[{"applicability":"自动质量验收反馈依据：明确当前修订重点为两项契约闭合：（1）清空时作废输入会话及处理迟到尾随 input/beforeinput 事件契约闭合，避免迟到事件造成旧文本回显或制造空值错误；（2）清空重置性能指标口径统一为清空处理至重绘前调度延迟（5轮均值\u003c=50ms），修正 passCriteria 残留的渲染耗时命名，并确认目标应用尚未实现、浏览器/性能测试保持 unexecuted。","content":"输入法清空后迟到input的契约仍未闭合...清空性能口径仍有残留。blk-deliv-val-perf-benchmark.passCriteria 写“清空重置渲染耗时”，但其steps测click事件起始→requestAnimationFrame重绘前回调，这只能是清空处理与重绘前调度的代理指标。将该指标在content、goal、normalBehavior、scope、verification、completionCriteria、steps、passCriteria和关联outcomes/acceptance中统一为准确名称，起止一致，保留五轮均值\u003c=50ms及待验证状态，不声称physical paint或用户实际看见已经测得。","hash":"452a979f9746008d197f842d0fc9b87efb8fb3ce9e0acc946425ea55a179e4bb","id":"evidence-30d95dfa-3be9-417e-b03f-5d832ac5ce03","kind":"user","location":"D:\\Temp\\User\\pa-quality-publish-N6k3tL\\projects\\proj-1791129999032\\runtime\\planning\\run-c0db49e0-1a0c-42d1-8771-8a8ee2cd2a83\\tools\\evidence\\evidence-30d95dfa-3be9-417e-b03f-5d832ac5ce03.json","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T23:09:08.115Z","outcome":"passed","source":"input:f1b903e2-8899-458d-a8cb-d51d9626df64"},{"applicability":"MDN 官方关于 Element beforeinput 事件规范，说明 IME 输入或自动填充时 beforeinput 可能不触发或不可取消，且各浏览器与操作系统行为存在差异；指出必须在 input 事件中处理并可能需要还原修改，为清空作废输入法会话与处理尾随 input 事件提供了原生事件模型依据。","content":"The DOM beforeinput event fires when the value of an \u003cinput\u003e or \u003ctextarea\u003e element is about to be modified... Not every user modification results in beforeinput firing. Also the event may fire but be non-cancelable. This may happen when the modification is done by autocomplete, by accepting a correction from a spell checker, by password manager autofill, by IME, or in other ways. The details vary by browser and OS. To override the edit behavior in all situations, the code needs to handle the input event and possibly revert any modifications that were not handled by the beforeinput handler.","hash":"503fcc079d50b1e61516932379ed978f5678585d2bf0822e3a564fe1edecd3c0","id":"evidence-18f59e4e-9480-4936-a783-15fc077dece9","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/beforeinput_event","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T23:08:58.619Z","outcome":"passed","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/beforeinput_event"},{"applicability":"MDN 官方关于 CompositionEvent 规范，阐明 DOM CompositionEvent 表示用户间接录入文本时发生的事件序列（compositionstart, compositionupdate, compositionend），说明其继承自 UIEvent/Event 且包含 data 属性，为分析输入法间接输入与原生 input 事件的相对生命周期、顺序及清理时作废会话提供了标准接口依据。","content":"The DOM CompositionEvent represents events that occur due to the user indirectly entering text... CompositionEvent.data: Returns the characters generated by the input method that raised the event; it varies depending on the type of event that generated the CompositionEvent object... See also: compositionstart, compositionend, compositionupdate.","hash":"7e3bb981dfbca3a5cbfe6f052853174df1d58890e94919ecff18e5579bdcd7fa","id":"evidence-230ed4dd-6147-43ad-99da-a5ddf632cc5a","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompositionEvent","obtainedAt":"2026-10-04T23:09:22.655Z","outcome":"passed","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompositionEvent"}],"followUp":[],"groups":[],"questions":[],"summary":"本阶段针对自动质量验收反馈 input:f1b903e2-8899-458d-a8cb-d51d9626df64 进行了官方技术查证与可行性证据分析，提出以下建议与事实依据：\n\n1. 输入法清空后迟到事件契约闭合：\n查证 MDN 关于 CompositionEvent 及 Element beforeinput 事件规范证实，在各浏览器和操作系统中，输入法合成期间与结束阶段的原生事件流存在差异，且 beforeinput 在 IME 场景下可能不可取消或触发顺序不一致。当前系统在 blk-tech-interface 中的 input 监听仅判断 !isComposing \u0026\u0026 !e.isComposing，当用户在 composition 期间点击清空，若输入法引擎抛出迟到的普通 input 事件，会导致非法重新拉起 300ms 防抖倒计时，进而产生空值错误或恢复旧输入。建议后续整合任务在数据模型、接口契约与异常处理中设计明确的输入会话/世代隔离或输入意图状态机，使清空操作能够隔离作废会话关联的尾随 input/beforeinput 事件，同时保留真实新输入的正常调度。\n受影响契约与块：blk-tech-data-model、blk-tech-interface、blk-tech-error、blk-deliv-task-input-workflow、blk-deliv-task-reset-workflow、blk-acc-input-display、blk-deliv-acc-full-e2e。\n\n2. 清空性能验收指标口径一致性：\n查证 MDN requestAnimationFrame 官方规范可知，该回调触发于浏览器执行下一次重绘之前，代表防抖逻辑完成至重绘前的时间戳，属于调度延迟代理指标而非物理渲染耗时。当前 blk-deliv-val-perf-benchmark.passCriteria 仍残留“清空重置渲染耗时”，与 steps 中的 click 到 requestAnimationFrame 测量定义冲突。建议后续整合任务将 passCriteria 指标命名统一修正为“清空重置至重绘前调度延迟”，维持 5 轮均值 \u003c= 50ms 判定边界，并如实标为目标应用尚未实现的待验证（unexecuted）状态。\n受影响契约与块：blk-prod-outcomes、blk-deliv-val-perf-benchmark。\n\n3. 环境与验证状态客观声明：\n当前规划宿主机未运行 Docker 守护进程，受控容器试验 unavailable，如实记录为 unexecuted，不重复尝试；目标前端应用尚未编写实现，端到端浏览器及性能测试保持待验证状态，不以推断冒充实测结果。","toolAction":"Finishing research task","toolSummary":"Task completion"}
